The replies:
###### Alan Zaslavsky <zaslavsk at hcp.med.harvard.edu>
some people have suggested something like the following:
tapply(1:length(X),strata,
        function(indices,x,ww) weighted.mean(y=x[indices],w=ww[indices]),
        x=X,ww=w)
